display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {FLast}(\cdot )]]></fr:tex>) of a grammar <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> are all the characters that may follow a word in the language of <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> in a string that is in the language of <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>.

  <fr:tex
display="block"><![CDATA[ \mathsf {FLast}(A) = \{ c ~|~ \exists  w , w_A . w_A \in  L(A) \land  w_Acw \in  L(A) \}]]></fr:tex></fr:p></fr:mainmatter><fr:backmatter /></fr:tree></fr:mainmatter><fr:backmatter /></fr:tree></fr:backmatter></fr:tree>